    "id": "p5-q67-response",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "67",
    "prompt": "Simplify the following.\n$$\\left(\\frac{125m^6}{27n^3}\\right)^{-\\frac23}$$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\dfrac{9n^2}{25m^4}$, $m,n\\ne0$.\n\nTake the cube root, then invert and square.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\left(\\frac{125m^6}{27n^3}\\right)^{-\\frac{2}{3}}&=\\left(\\frac{5m^2}{3n}\\right)^{-2}\\\\\\left(\\frac{125m^6}{27n^3}\\right)^{-\\frac{2}{3}}&=\\left(\\frac{3n}{5m^2}\\right)^2\\\\\\left(\\frac{125m^6}{27n^3}\\right)^{-\\frac{2}{3}}&=\\frac{9n^2}{25m^4}\\end{align*}$$\nThe original denominator and negative power require $m,n\\ne0$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 28
  },
